<title>USA: Seer Technologies former CFO rejoins firm.</title>
<headline>Seer Technologies former CFO rejoins firm.</headline>
<dateline>CARY, N.C. 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Seer Technologies Inc said on Monday that Steven Dmiszewicki will be returning as senior vice president and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>In July, Dmiszewicki resigned as chief financial officer to join HealthPoint G.P., a North Carolina healthcare information systems and services company.</p>
<p>Marc Baric, the company's executive vice president, had been acting chief financial officer while Dmiszewicki was gone.</p>
<p>Dmiszewicki said the opportunity to rejoin Seer was &quot;a challenge I just can't resist.&quot;</p>
